# Docker build context is the repo root (projects reference each other via ProjectReference),
# so keep the context small and free of local build artifacts.

**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/publish
**/.vs
**/.vscode-test
**/*.vsix
**/local.settings.json

durablefunctionsmonitor-vscodeext/backend
durablefunctionsmonitor-vscodeext/custom-backends
durablefunctionsmonitor-vscodeext/out
durablefunctionsmonitor.react/node_modules

# The UI is built inside the image (the `ui` stage of every Dockerfile), so neither its install nor
# its output belongs in the context - and neither does any DfmStatics a working tree already holds.
durablefunctionsmonitor.svelte/node_modules
durablefunctionsmonitor.svelte/build
durablefunctionsmonitor.svelte/test-results
durablefunctionsmonitor.svelte/playwright-report
**/DfmStatics

.git
.github
readme
